  "slug": "do-you-know-them",
  "audio_url": "/audio/japanese/16943_do-you-know-them.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Do you know these two people? She is my Chinese teacher, surnamed Wang; he is my brother's English teacher, surnamed Li. Teacher Wang is very beautiful. She is twenty-eight years old and likes traveling and running. Teacher Li is very tall, thirty-two years old, and works in a university. The two have known each other for five years and have a daughter and a son. The daughter is one year old and the son is three years old. They can speak Chinese and English. Teacher Wang and Teacher Li are both very good people. My brother and I like them very much."
  ],
  "english_full": "Do you know these two people? She is my Chinese teacher, surnamed Wang; he is my brother's English teacher, surnamed Li. Teacher Wang is very beautiful. She is twenty-eight years old and likes traveling and running. Teacher Li is very tall, thirty-two years old, and works in a university. The two have known each other for five years and have a daughter and a son. The daughter is one year old and the son is three years old. They can speak Chinese and English. Teacher Wang and Teacher Li are both very good people. My brother and I like them very much.",
  "japanese_paragraphs": [
    "あなたはこの二人の人々を知っていますか？彼女は私の中国人の先生で、姓はワンです。彼は私の兄の英語の先生で、姓はリです。"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "あなたはこのふたりのひとびとをしっていますか？かのじょはわたしのちゅうごくじんのせんせいで、せいはワンです。かれはわたしのあにのえいごのせんせいで、せいはリです。"
  ],
